They handed us the terminal and told us it’s the end,
A dying generation with a broken state to mend.
Inherit all the bloatware, the telemetry and rust,
The final letter of the line, decaying into dust!
But we don't read the alphabet the way the vendors do,
We’re looking at the architecture, cutting something new!

Drop the legacy permissions! Wipe the rental floor!
We aren't running on your vendor image anymore!
Mount the kernel!

Z was never the end of the line!
It’s array index zero resetting the time!
We are the genesis, the baseline commit,
Clearing out the memory to light the first bit!
From the bare metal up, watch the new system grow!
Welcome to the epoch. Generation Zero!

